<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>SomerandomMVNTplayer</Major>
    <Description>Okay so to put it inna better way, Inspect spamming is where spam your inspect on your heirloom, gun, or fists while running, standing, the only downside to this, is that you have to hold it for like a 2 seconds before stopping, feel free to edit this.!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 17 1
Delay 5 ms
KeyUp 17 1
Delay 5 ms
KeyDown 17 1
Delay 5 ms
KeyUp 17 1
Delay 5 ms
GoWhile 1 30</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Apex Legends</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>